. tabstat publiccost2024 totalcost2024 pubpct100, stats(median, sum) format

{txt}   Stats {...}
{c |}{...}
  pub~2024  tot~2024  pubp~100
{hline 9}{c +}{hline 30}
{ralign 8:p50} {...}
{c |}{...}
