{txt}(0 real changes made)

{com}. replace renovation_amount2024=renovation_amount*1.88 if lastrenovation ==1999
{txt}(1 real change made)

{com}. replace renovation_amount2024=renovation_amount*1.82 if lastrenovation ==2000
{txt}(0 real changes made)

