{txt}(0 real changes made)

{com}. replace renovation_amount2024=renovation_amount*1.61 if lastrenovation ==2005
{txt}(0 real changes made)

{com}. replace renovation_amount2024=renovation_amount*1.56 if lastrenovation ==2006
{txt}(0 real changes made)

{com}. replace renovation_amount2024=renovation_amount*1.51 if lastrenovation ==2007
{txt}(0 real changes made)

